Named/exotics: `weapons.ts`. High-end bases: `he-weapons.ts`. Pickable HE talents: `weapon-talents.ts`. Mod caps: `weapon-mods.ts`.

Locked named/exotic mods belong in `extraStats`, not talent text and not fake `assumed` Weapon Damage.

Y8S3 facts (do not regress):

- **Determined** = Perfect Determined: true headshot kill guarantees the next crit headshot; a kill from that converted shot does **not** chain. Types: mmr / rifle / pistol only. Body-to-headshot chaining is **Iron Will** (gear catalog), not this talent. Relic / Prophet use the same no-chain wording.
- **Boiling Point** is a pickable HE talent (first 53% mag −100% CHC, rest 100%). Perfect (Teapot, Steamer) is 48%.
- **Steel & Sons ACR** is an exotic ACR SS rifle (`steel-and-sons`), talent Confirm & Execute, max stacks 4, weak-point +30% amp / 5s.
- **Fafnir**: Dragon's Breath 40% Burn, WD amplified by 50% of Status Effects; locked +15% CHC / +5 mag / +10% handling as `extraStats`. No averaged +WD assumed. RPM/mag unpublished by Ubisoft — do not invent.
- **Quickstep** is a named Tactical M1911 pistol (`quickstep`), talent Sport Mode: +20% movement speed while unholstered, does not stack with other MS bonuses. Family RPM/mag is **310 / 7** (mx live BuildStation, same as Mozambique Special). Not a meme seasonal — keep it. Do not model MS as fake Weapon Damage.
- **Prima Donna** is an exotic Mk20 SSR MMR (`prima-donna`), Paradise Lost, 55 RPM / mag 7, talent You can look... but you can't touch. Out-of-combat stacks are not averaged as Weapon Damage.
- **Head Scratcher** is a pickable HE talent (30% amp vs confused / 4 kills). Perfect 35% / 3 kills is named-only:
  - **Insult To Injury** (`insult-to-injury`) — SA80 LMG, 610 RPM / mag 30
  - **Brain Break** (`brain-break`) — MDR rifle, 360 RPM / mag 20
  Do not add Perfect Head Scratcher to the HE picker.
- **First Bloom** (`first-bloom`) — named PDR AR, 700 / 30, talent Blossom Harvest (3.3% amp per 10% combined Armor+Health remaining). Not sheet WD.
- **Rabid D50** (`rabid-d50`) — named D50, 200 RPM / mag 8, talent Foam at the Mouth (HS kill → Ensnare next hit; +25% amp vs Ensnared). Not sheet WD. HE D50 family is 200 / 8.
- **TDI "Kard" Custom** (`tdi-kard`) — named KARD-45, 310 / 10. Unique **+1 Skill Tier while drawn** (`extraStats`), talent slot recalibratable. Not Perfectly Unhinged.
- Unique-attribute nameds (no Perfect talent, talent slot recalibratable):
  - **Stack Broker** (`stack-broker`) — ACS-12, 360 / 20 (official Veteran Rewards: higher RoF, lower base damage)
  - **Slingshot** (`slingshot`) — Tactical UMP-45, 650 / 25, innate 60m Optimal Range
  - **Handbasket** (`handbasket`) — SVD, 60 / 10 (higher base damage, slower RPM than SVD 260)
- Named family RPM/mag (mx live, case-by-case — not a mass overwrite): Kingbreaker / TKB-408 600/30; Dare & Cricket / GR9 750/200; Harmony / Resolute MK47 300/30; Relic & Sacrum Imperium / G28 180/20; Teapot M4 rifle 360/30; Steamer & Lud SCAR-L 650/30.
- Do not add Perfect-only HE talents (Allegro, Streamline, …) unless they are on the live picker.
- Skip **October Fifth** (unobtainable) and meme seasonals (Oh Carol, Sleigher, Bell Ringer, Festive Delivery…).
- mx-division-builds live API (`buildstation.app/api/td2/v2/data/mx/…`) is a community catalog for **existence + family + RPM/mag + talent name/text**. Do not copy its GitHub CSVs (stale brands). Do not mass-overwrite our Y8S3 brand/set numbers or HE picker. Skip meme seasonals and D1 leftovers (Nimble Holster, NinjaBike-as-kneepads).

Sources: Red Horizon article + live gear PDF; mx live API for named gaps. `npm test` after edits.
